  "generated": "---\ntitle: \"Chats and messages\"\nslug: \"/apps/ios-chats-and-messages--spo1958jr171lshad3f2rqgl\"\nmdx: {\"format\":\"md\"}\ntags: [\"iOS\",\"General\",\"ios\",\"working-with-chats\"]\n---\n\nUsing the mobile app, you can send a text message to a colleague directly via ‘**Personal**’ chat or to a group of colleagues using a ‘**Group**’ chat.\n\nThe ‘**Chats**’ tab is where all of your chat conversations - all the messages you’ve sent and received, are displayed.\n\nIt is also where you can create a new ‘**Personal**’, ‘**Group**’, or ‘**SMS**’ chat.\n\nYou can initiate a chat with a colleague using one of the following options:\n\n- Open your colleague’s [Profile](/docs/apps/ios-working-with-contacts--fkd2qyccst8qw7mnpdkeyppp) . And pressing the**chat**__icon__.\n\n* Select an existing chat in the ‘**Chats**’ tab.\n\n- Create a new chat by pressing on the![App icon](/img/ringotel/original/c4c15a8e5eb3ee1b8b03/fa3a72562096b836374e36cd269b0df33a7f0e2f9e4e5848d2541289d92ba5fc.png)icon at the top right corner of the screen and then selecting the type of chat you would like to create.\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/de41767077777ad39393/ea7d61e45e6bb436072d6f0fd58f7f6c0d8adedfa5fa56c627aaaa92f66f76d1.png)\n\n![](/img/ringotel/original/1c0cd6fd2ee371501be6/98b53d7df5a8a539d65d68fc1ade4ed3121b82c5a9a010b0550de68552da67fe.png)\n\n## Related articles\n\n- [Chats and messages overview](/docs/apps/desktop-chats-and-messages--s2tpb7mo6h2emho461usba3h)\n- [Starting a Group chat](/docs/apps/ios-create-a-group-chat--ul52pe9cejm5vodlxm05zg0o)\n- [Sending messages and media](/docs/apps/ios-sending-messages-and-media--i8makyr075gev6h6elawa5hf)\n"
